{"event_type":"review","id":"44ad5d66af203a3f8eb6915defba2b73852ae198f41ef35a7298ef4221aa93d4","occurred_at":"2026-11-07T05:26:26Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0b5b2f70f0b46c624109e4f4119cf814d10293b78e91d44cde1114ed4ab56057","sha256":"0b5b2f70f0b46c624109e4f4119cf814d10293b78e91d44cde1114ed4ab56057"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4532c47adfcde22d9fc0341760a8c0e4b482bcebb7cdd96d301754902cc1e671","sha256":"4532c47adfcde22d9fc0341760a8c0e4b482bcebb7cdd96d301754902cc1e671"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/a71357512f6027ad7269b6552969ea8289d310eca2cfc9aa055873e99f1fcb95","sha256":"a71357512f6027ad7269b6552969ea8289d310eca2cfc9aa055873e99f1fcb95"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f880e12166cf87d72779621f83292d82522eb0259582051f07f7fb185ed17b90","sha256":"f880e12166cf87d72779621f83292d82522eb0259582051f07f7fb185ed17b90"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b35045567bdbae2219281742edb6da4236dc60ef819d10f23769a4e437e9a248","sha256":"b35045567bdbae2219281742edb6da4236dc60ef819d10f23769a4e437e9a248"}],"attempt_id":"9538cdbd588fb7d1c9e62cccf1ba75cf4c9c45d61dbf1ec9c877bac042da5a14:0:1","base":"abb5855f4b1f32a3d6ae234272c8327f965cd8b5","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"88e86612a8f6400a7cd820ba0fe27a9e6193b291","body":"**Resolve the compare base from `origin`, not the local branch.**\n\n`resolveFixPrBase` returns a bare branch name after confirming `refs/remotes/origin/<branch>` exists. The compare lookup then passes that bare name to `rev-parse`, which resolves a local ref instead.\n\n- If no local branch with that name exists, `rev-parse` fails. `githubCompareBase` returns `undefined`, so the compare link is omitted.\n- If the local branch lags `origin`, the compare link uses that older SHA.\n\nPassing the origin ref makes the lookup use the SHA of the branch the PR targets. `githubCompareBase` uses the SHA only to build the URL, so the branch name used for the PR is unchanged.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n           const compareBase = report.tasks.some((task) => task.failedAttemptPublished)\n-            ? await githubCompareBase(repoRoot, assembly.base)\n+            ? await githubCompareBase(repoRoot, `refs/remotes/origin/${assembly.base}`)\n             : undefined;\n```\n\n</details>","id":"accd6ea7388d157832ebd2e275224de4761c1a0e045cd1ac63501bdac059f315","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/fix/runFix.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Resolve the compare base from `origin`, not the local branch."}],"head":"c2f72cbfac723c89614ba9a1e07fe22256d9e62e","head_tree":"a619b07177492e5c80d4ce45880731ec409f8b2c","input_scope":[{"blob":"88e86612a8f6400a7cd820ba0fe27a9e6193b291","intervals":[[1,1202]],"path":"src/ops/fix/runFix.ts"}],"job_id":"9538cdbd588fb7d1c9e62cccf1ba75cf4c9c45d61dbf1ec9c877bac042da5a14:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"88e86612a8f6400a7cd820ba0fe27a9e6193b291","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/fix/runFix.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"88e86612a8f6400a7cd820ba0fe27a9e6193b291","intervals":[[11,11],[20,21],[23,24],[109,109],[138,139],[198,198],[229,229],[263,307],[348,353],[362,362],[372,378],[508,557],[560,568],[570,570],[579,579],[582,582],[667,674],[700,711],[732,732],[770,785],[787,789],[795,795],[806,812],[826,826],[917,927],[940,945],[960,967],[1031,1031]],"path":"src/ops/fix/runFix.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"88e86612a8f6400a7cd820ba0fe27a9e6193b291","intervals":[